abstract: >-
  Open-source workspace for the Data A track of the KamaTech Robo-Greeno
  project: a swarm of six-legged spider robots for agricultural settings.
  Covers hexapod kinematics, tripod/wave/ripple gait generation, IMU
  stabilization, and reinforcement-learning locomotion in MuJoCo, targeting
  ESP32 + Raspberry Pi class hardware. Includes an intuitive Physical AI
  tutorial series.
